author":"刘克庄","text":"作苦三时逸在冬，安知一篑尚亏功。\n愁闻地籁吹羊角，不见天瓢滴马鬃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30221,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋旱继以大风即事十首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"蘋末萧萧忽怒飞，松公欲仆竹君攲。\n无人委曲镌风伯，晚稻方花最怕吹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30222,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋旱继以大风即事十首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"虽作尧时击壤民，田家忧乐尚关身。\n抱珠难起龙公睡，走石谁撩飓毋嗔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30223,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋望二首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"舍南舍北种芙蓉，及到秋来次第红。\n自是诗人才思窘，清风明月有何穷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30224,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋望二首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"暮色苍然上野台，废塘尚有数荷开。\n望中爱杀城南柳，只怕霜风一夜来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30225,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"种柳","author":"刘克庄","text":"少少旗亭夹道边，小桥终日水潺湲。\n垂杨种后方二尺，惆怅成阴是几年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30226,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"种莲一首","author":"刘克庄","text":"姝丽如同产，朱铅各异施。\n吾方参素女，渠自比□□。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30227,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句二首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"浮荣已是卿惭长，勇退犹称相避贤。\n先帝赐金挥未尽，不应全仰作碑钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30228,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句二首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"枝上好花无十日，松梢老叶有千年。\n静中勘破人间世，醒者常愚醉者贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30229,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句二首赠月蓬道人过建安谒刘漕中书 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"只有破裘禦寒色，遍将甜卦卖痴人。\n那知两个非师弟，一是钟离一洞宾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30230,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句二首赠月蓬道人过建安谒刘漕中书 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"两过道人争一蓬，岂非名号偶然同。\n樗翁赖是无权柄，往问无家铁壁翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30231,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句三首 其三","author":"刘克庄","text":"潘郎鬓岂春能绿，东野肩非雪亦寒。\n世外那无仙可学，人间惟有老难瞒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30232,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句三首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"愁肠一饮辄无算，病眼四时常有花。\n旧日读书垂钓处，重寻如到别人家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30233,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句三首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"定本兰亭传赝久，党公姜字发蒙初。\n儿童若问何人写，向道樗翁八十馀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30234,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荔支盛熟四绝 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"绣行乡国诧儿童，锦裹宫城擅长雄。\n看取后村真富贵，屋山丹绘半天中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30235,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荔支盛熟四绝 其三","author":"刘克庄","text":"牡丹姚魏荔方陈，欧蔡亡来罕识真。\n纵使有文堪续谱，未知楷法属何人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30236,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荔支盛熟四绝 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"曾攀玉李青冥上，亦摘蟠桃缥缈边。\n定是三生有灵骨，谪归犹作荔支仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30237,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荔支盛熟四绝 其四","author":"刘克庄","text":"吴儿一夏甑生尘，染藕炊菱不疗贫。\n安得风樯驰万树，属餍菜色苋肠人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30238,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荔枝二首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"寂寂南州少物华，有园池处只梅茶。\n荔枝花发差平等，不问贫家富贵家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30239,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荔枝二首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"去年一颗难钻核，今岁千林尽著花。\n老子有方能辟谷，纯将绛雪代丹砂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30240,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荔枝龙眼二绝 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"食观本草岂非痴，二果甘滋可养脾。\n耄智自知无益处，肉身安得有轻时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30241,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荔枝龙眼二绝 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"味尝不暇更论斤，买断何曾敢算缗。\n谱与本经俱过眼，食之不老者何人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30242,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"药洲四首 其四","author":"刘克庄","text":"观寺临湖上，亭台出柳间。\n都忘来五岭，将谓在孤山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30243,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"药洲四首 其三","author":"刘克庄","text":"怪怪奇奇石，谁能辨丑妍。\n莫教赞皇见，定辇入平泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":30244,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]